+{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[{"->":"start"},["done",{"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"start":["#","^set_global:debrief_played:true","/#","#","^speaker:narrator","/#","^Narrator: SAFETYNET headquarters. The morning after WhiteHat Security.","\n","#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: There you are. Sit down before you fall down.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},0,"==",{"VAR?":"exec_office_entered"},"&&",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_told_safetynet"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_bribed"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_challenged"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","#","^set_global:perfect_stealth_earned:true","/#","#","^unlock_aim:perfect_stealth","/#","#","^complete_task:zero_detection","/#","^Agent HaX: First thing I checked: the guard never once saw you. That's a rare night's work.","\n",{"->":"start.33"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},0,"==",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard never logged you. Mind you, he spent most of the night unconscious, so I'm not calling it stealth.","\n",{"->":"start.43"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},0,"==",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_told_safetynet"},{"VAR?":"guard_bribed"},"||","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_bribed"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard never logged you, because you'd paid your way past him. Five hundred pounds of ours. Finance will want a receipt.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard never logged you, because you'd talked your way past him. Effective. Not stealth.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"start.58"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},0,"==",{"VAR?":"guard_challenged"},"&&",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_told_safetynet"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_bribed"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard stopped you once. He never caught you at a lock, but he'll remember your face.","\n",{"->":"start.77"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},0,"==",{"VAR?":"exec_wing_entered"},"&&",{"VAR?":"exec_office_entered"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_told_safetynet"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_bribed"},"!","&&",{"VAR?":"guard_challenged"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard never saw you. Then again, you never gave him the chance.","\n",{"->":"start.102"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},1,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard caught you once, and then you put him on the floor. The log's mostly about that now.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Security flagged one run-in with the guard that turned ugly. You got clear of him, but it's on the log.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.6"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"start.110"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},1,">","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The guard clocked you ","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},2,"==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^twice",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["^more than twice",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","^. You got it done. Nobody's going to call it quiet.","\n",{"->":"start.118"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_told_safetynet"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You told Sterling's own guard who you work for. He rang her.","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^ko","/str","!=","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["^ That's one reason she had her coat on when you walked in.",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"start.124"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"guard_bribed"},{"VAR?":"guard_detection_count"},0,">",{"VAR?":"guard_knocked_out"},"||","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And there's five hundred pounds of ours in a security guard's pocket. Finance will want a receipt.","\n",{"->":"start.136"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"receptionist_ko"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: The receptionist, Ffion Rees, is fine, before you ask. Concussed, and still trying to work out what she did to deserve it.","\n",{"->":"start.142"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"mission_impact"},null],"mission_impact":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: The network first. All four flags, and the distcc logs are the case.","\n","^Agent HaX: The ProFTPD backdoor, sold to Ghost, invoice ZDS-2024-0847, St. Catherine's on the target line, Sable's sign-off on the approval.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"called_it_murder"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: In the briefing you said they'd put a price on it being a hospital. Now we can prove they knew.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"victoria_discussion"},null],"victoria_discussion":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Victoria Sterling. Sable.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^recruited","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"victoria_recruited"},{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^arrested","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"victoria_arrested"},{"->":".^.^.^.23"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^ko","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"victoria_ko"},{"->":".^.^.^.33"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^escaped","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"victoria_escaped"},{"->":".^.^.^.43"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},null],"victoria_recruited":[["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: And now she's ours. That was a hell of a call -- turning her instead of taking her.","\n","ev","str","^She's worth more as a source than a headline.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Phase 2 puts thousands at risk. Her intelligence gets us in front of it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Given the whole picture, it was the right call.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: I agree. Just stay clear-eyed. Someone who thinks they're right is the hardest asset to hold.","\n",{"->":"victoria_recruited_path"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: If she delivers. If she isn't burned. If the Architect doesn't smell it. A lot of ifs riding on a woman who invoices by the body.","\n",{"->":"victoria_recruited_path"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"handler_trust"},10,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"handler_trust","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","^Agent HaX: You were there. You made it. I'll back it.","\n",{"->":"victoria_recruited_path"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"victoria_recruited_path":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Counter-intelligence is running her now. She stays at Zero Day, and the first package is already in: the Architect's comms protocols, the payment rails, contacts at the other cells.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"usb_seen"},{"VAR?":"lore_directive_found"},"||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And she knew you already had the directive. That's why she didn't try to sell us the parts we had.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX: Netherton signed off at six this morning. He had me write \"she priced a hospital\" on the cover sheet.","\n","^Agent HaX: Whether she stays turned is anyone's guess. Today, it's a win with its teeth showing.","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},null],"victoria_arrested":[["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: In custody. Conspiracy, computer misuse, and they want St. Catherine's on the charge sheet.","\n","^Agent HaX: Her lawyers are already calling it \"market-driven research\". It won't hold.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"named_target_selection"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Not with \"target selection, ten thousand\" on her own invoice. And you got her to call it consultancy on an open line.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.11"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^She'll call it consultancy in court too.","/str",{"VAR?":"named_target_selection"},"/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":21},"ev","str","^She picked St. Catherine's off a survey of two hundred and fourteen.","/str",{"VAR?":"named_target_selection"},"!",{"VAR?":"transaction_log_read"},{"VAR?":"roster_seen"},"||","&&","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":21},"ev","str","^People died on what she sold. This is for St. Catherine's.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^Take the arms dealer, and every buyer downstream feels it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: Targeting. That's the word the CPS will use.","\n",{"->":"victoria_arrested_path"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: Targeting. That's the word the CPS will use.","\n",{"->":"victoria_arrested_path"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"handler_trust"},10,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"handler_trust","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","^Agent HaX: Yes. It is. ","#","^delivery: quietly","/#","\n",{"->":"victoria_arrested_path"},{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","^Agent HaX: Every buyer downstream just lost their supplier. They'll pay more for worse.","\n",{"->":"victoria_arrested_path"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"victoria_arrested_path":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Her keys opened the client database, the transaction records, the Architect's channels. We're rolling the network up while it's still warm.","\n","^Agent HaX: Netherton's taking the file to the CPS himself. He doesn't, usually.","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},null],"victoria_ko":[["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Sterling went down on site. She's in a guarded bed, not a boardroom.","\n","^Agent HaX: We've got the evidence and the name either way. The Architect loses an operator -- she just won't be talking to us about it.","\n","ev","str","^She priced in how fast hospitals pay. She'd earned the file.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Unconscious, she tells us nothing. We kept the case, lost the network.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: Hard to argue. She'll wake up to a charge sheet.","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: A trade, and you made it.","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"victoria_escaped":[["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Sterling's in the wind. She had a bag packed before you ever crossed the threshold.","\n","^Agent HaX: We've got the case. The transaction log puts Sable's name on the sale. What we don't have is her.","\n","^Agent HaX: Netherton put her on every watch list we can reach. Did it himself, before I'd finished the sentence.","\n","ev","str","^The proof doesn't run. She's a signature on it now, wherever she is.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^She goes dark, rebuilds, comes back as someone else. The cost of letting her walk.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"handler_trust"},5,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"handler_trust","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","^Agent HaX: A cold read, and a defensible one. She'll surface. We'll be holding the file when she does.","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: It is. But she walks knowing we can prove all of it. That changes how she moves.","\n",{"->":"phase_2_discussion"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"phase_2_discussion":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"usb_seen"},{"VAR?":"lore_directive_found"},"||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"directive_decoded"},{"VAR?":"directive_guessed"},"!","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Now Phase 2, the part that kept me up. You brought out the drive and read both layers yourself. The Architect's directive.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Now Phase 2, the part that kept me up. Your drive was Base64 over ROT13; our people had it off in ten minutes. The Architect's directive.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.9"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Now Phase 2, the part that kept me up. The search team found a drive in Sterling's desk this morning. Base64 over ROT13. The Architect's directive.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.10"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"directive_substance"},null],"directive_substance":[["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: Grid storage. Substation control. Hospitals on generator for when the grid drops out from under them. Zero Day supplies, Critical Mass executes. Winter, within weeks.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^escaped","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: She told you St. Catherine's was a proof of concept. She wasn't showing off.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: St. Catherine's was the test run. This is the order book.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.14"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev","str","^That's mass-casualty scale. An attack on everyone under the grid.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^We have the sectors and the window. We can move first for once.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^One hand is behind all of it.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Agent HaX: It is. And timed across cells.","\n",{"->":"architect_revelation"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Agent HaX: We're already moving. For once we've got the head start.","\n",{"->":"architect_revelation"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^Agent HaX: Yes. And that's the thread we pull next.","\n",{"->":"architect_revelation"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"architect_revelation":[["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: The Architect. One mind coordinating the cells. Zero Day arms them, Critical Mass hits the grid, Ransomware Incorporated hits the wards, and someone times it all.","\n","^Agent HaX: Until last night the Architect was a rumour. Now it's a signature on a plan. Command's had it since first thing.","\n","ev","str","^Any lead on who the Architect actually is?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^This is the map to their whole operation.","/str",{"VAR?":"usb_seen"},{"VAR?":"lore_directive_found"},"||","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":21},"ev","str","^So that drive is the map to their whole operation.","/str",{"VAR?":"usb_seen"},{"VAR?":"lore_directive_found"},"||","!","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":21},{"c-0":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^recruited","/str","==",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^arrested","/str","==","||","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Not yet. Sterling swears she's never met them -- all encrypted channels. But every operation like this narrows it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],[{"->":".^.b"},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Not yet. All we have is encrypted channels and a signature. But every operation like this narrows it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"architect_investigation"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","ev",{"VAR?":"handler_trust"},10,"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"handler_trust","re":true},"#","^influence_increased","/#","^Agent HaX: You handed us the shape of the thing.","\n",{"->":"architect_investigation"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^Agent HaX: It is. Next time, bring it out yourself.","\n",{"->":"architect_investigation"},{"#f":5}]}],null],"architect_investigation":["#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","^Agent HaX: The Phase 2 target list goes out unsigned. Substations get hardened, hospitals get assessed, and we'll be standing where they meant to strike.","\n",{"->":"danny_discussion"},null],"danny_discussion":["ev",{"VAR?":"danny_ko"},{"VAR?":"danny_fate"},"str","^ko","/str","!=","&&",{"VAR?":"danny_fate"},"str","^","/str","!=","&&","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n",{"->":"danny_ko_after_choice"},{"->":".^.^.^.16"},null]}],"nop","\n","#","^speaker:agent_0x99","/#","ev",{"VAR?":"danny_fate"},"str","^protected","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Danny Foster took the way in you gave him. He rang us just after midnight, and our people collected him at two.","\n","^Agent HaX: He brought a box file and the photo off his desk, and he hasn't stopped talking since.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_approach"},"str","^diplomatic","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You didn't push. He noticed.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX: He won't be charged. He'll carry it anyway.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"defended_danny"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: I played him the part of the comms log where you told Sterling what drawing that survey had cost him. He asked to hear it again.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.21"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^recruited","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Here's the knot. Danny thinks Sterling's going down. She isn't. She's ours, and his statement stays sealed or she's burned inside a week.","\n","^Agent HaX: As far as Zero Day knows, he's off sick with stress. Which isn't even a lie.","\n","^Agent HaX: Somebody has to tell him she's walking. It should be you.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.31"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^arrested","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: He asked which floor they're holding Sterling on. I didn't tell him.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.41"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^escaped","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You told him she'd answer for it. She's in the wind. He asked me this morning if that was still true. I said \"not yet\".","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.51"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"danny_reply_protected"},{"->":".^.^.^.29"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"danny_fate"},"str","^exposed","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Danny Foster. You logged the lot -- the recon, the emails, the raise he took to stay quiet.","\n","^Agent HaX: He's been arrested. He'd worked out what it was for before he took it. A court will care about the date.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_approach"},"str","^aggressive","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You went in hard and stayed hard. I won't argue with it.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX: He'll likely get years, not a life sentence -- the deception's real and he's cooperating. But he serves.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"defended_danny"},"/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: His solicitor's heard the part of the comms log where you told Sterling what drawing that survey had cost him. She'll use it. It won't change the charge.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.21"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^recruited","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: So the woman who lied to him gets a deal, and he gets a court date. I'll sign off on it. I won't pretend it's tidy.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.31"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"victoria_fate"},"str","^escaped","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: And with Sterling in the wind, he's the only one from Zero Day standing in the dock. Juries notice that.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.41"},null]}],"nop","\n",{"->":"danny_reply_exposed"},{"->":".^.^.^.39"},null]}],"nop","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"danny_fate"},"str","^left","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: Danny Foster. You left the decision with him. Didn't shield him, didn't hang him. Just handed it back.","\n","^Agent HaX: He hasn't called. His phone's been off since last night and he's not at home.","\n","ev",{"VAR?":"player_approach"},"str","^cautious","/str","==","/ev",[{"->":".^.b","c":true},{"b":["\n","^Agent HaX: You let him choose. He chose to switch his phone off.","\n",{"->":".^.^.^.13"},null]}],"nop","\n","^Agent HaX